00:59:14.940 --> 00:59:22.420
And he said, well, I was supposed to be upset and sad because I wanted this Princess Unicorn
玩偶送给女儿，而达里尔也想要这个玩偶送给他女儿，我得表现得非常

1399
00:59:22.420 --> 00:59:27.200
doll for my daughter and Daryl wanted the doll for his daughter and I needed to be really
